      "body": "Probably uncommon to configure the output at a leaf command, but the side-effect isn't the intended behaviour. `.configureOutput()` should merge to a new object instead of merging in place.\n\nThis will change the behaviour for people configuring output after setting up subcommands (not the intended pattern), which can be touched on in the release notes. (Note to self: check README too.)",
